# app/frontend/** holds generated production build output (Vite/lit-html
# bundles). Minified bundles routinely contain literal whitespace inside
# string/template-literal content that `git diff --check` flags as
# "trailing whitespace" even though it is not a textual defect — it is
# part of the generated bytes. Disabling the `whitespace` attribute here
# only silences that diagnostic; it does not touch `diff`, `text`, or any
# binary treatment, so normal textual diffs for these paths are unaffected.
app/frontend/** -whitespace
